    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 10 - Voice Notes to Tasks\nSend a voice note on Telegram and get back structured notes in seconds.\n\n1. Whisper transcribes the audio (Arabic dialects + English).\n2. AI extracts a title, summary, decisions and action items, turning \"بكرا\" or \"next Thursday\" into real dates.\n3. You get a clean Telegram reply with the transcript in an expandable quote.\n4. The note is saved in Google Sheets and each action item becomes a **Google Task**.\n\n**Limits:** voice or audio files up to 15 minutes. Restrict the trigger to your chat ID in production.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 4
      },
